Vercel Newsletter - March 2026

Fluid compute pricing
Functions now bill on active CPU time rather than wall-clock duration. For most apps that wait on databases and APIs, that means a lower bill with no code change. See the pricing page for details.

AI Gateway is generally available
One endpoint, every major model provider, with automatic failover, spend limits and per-model usage reports. Bring your own keys or use ours.

Ship 2026
Our annual conference is June 24, New York and online. Registration opens next month.

Also this month: Next.js 16.2 with faster builds, a new observability dashboard for edge requests, and Vercel Agent in preview.

Read the full changelog: https://vercel.com/changelog

